...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

launch: Product Launch Analyst { class: ours }
openai: OpenAI API { class: ext }
firecrawl_tool: FirecrawlTools { class: ours }
firecrawl_api: Firecrawl API (api.firecrawl.dev) { class: ext }

launch -> openai: 지시문 + task + FirecrawlTools 스키마
openai -> launch: tool_call search_web(query)
launch -> firecrawl_tool: search_web(query)
firecrawl_tool -> firecrawl_api: app.search(query, limit)
firecrawl_api -> firecrawl_tool: 검색 결과
firecrawl_tool -> launch: 검색 결과 JSON
launch -> openai: 도구 결과 포함 재요청
